{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Here, we report findings from turning motions with and without FoG in PwPD, in whom we previously reported neuronal abnormalities related to FoG occurring during regular walking.\",\n    \"The aim of this study was to characterize the subthalamic signature of freezing while turning.\",\n    \"Our findings advance the pathophysiological understanding of the neural mechanisms underlying freezing while turning\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"Posted Date: May 6th, 2026\",\n    \"DOI: https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-9617843/v1\",\n    \"Research Article\",\n    \"Supplementary material is available at NPJ Parkinson's Disease online.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的实质性描述有全文依据。论文明确报告了帕金森病患者转弯及转弯过程中冻结（freezing while turning）的研究，包含实验方法、神经信号分析、运动学结果和分类模型，因此将其描述为提供新的转弯任务证据并无明显误读。但附件只有论文全文，没有报告第五章5.3的正文及其引用位置，因而无法直接核实报告是否确实遗漏了预印本状态标注，整体判为partly。指控者的描述也有部分依据：论文首页列出了Research Square格式的DOI、版本号v1和Posted Date，表明这是一份有明确发布日期和版本信息的在线稿件。不过，全文没有明确出现“preprint”“not peer-reviewed”或“not yet peer-reviewed”等表述，也没有明确声明尚未完成同行评审。另一方面，全文还写有补充材料可在NPJ Parkinson's Disease在线获取。因此，仅凭全文可以支持其具有预印本式发布信息，但不能将其未经同行评审、并非正式期刊论文这一判断视为全文明确证实的事实。两个判断均为partly。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f856ef06-e9f9-46e7-8a65-bc7f2a7ae928", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T114457694911Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:46:29.571670+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "10ea58d696e06ba9a20f2b44627dbb10da0cb55b4a9d6dbac0f93bf58f7145bc", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T114457694911Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e2863215ff9ad0919014c48a4cbf983a5373ba04f4aa92cdc35d2b1e6db24270"}}}
